{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >// New Employee Onboarding: Quantum Computing //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below are <i>classical bits</i>, which all regular computers operate on. Boooooring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/e48b05bdbd2bbf00a4ed5d10979dd8e1.poster.avif?t=1754065747\" width=400 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/e48b05bdbd2bbf00a4ed5d10979dd8e1.webm?t=1754065747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/e48b05bdbd2bbf00a4ed5d10979dd8e1.mp4?t=1754065747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more exciting are\u00a0<i>quantum bits</i>\u00a0(or <i>qubits</i> for short), which are not limited to simple {0,1} states.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0  \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/39db046652040981ac0a914a2f2353f7.poster.avif?t=1754065747\" width=400 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/39db046652040981ac0a914a2f2353f7.webm?t=1754065747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/39db046652040981ac0a914a2f2353f7.mp4?t=1754065747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qubits are so hot right now! They are the building blocks of newfangled\u00a0<i>quantum computers</i>. As newly-minted employees of The Qubit Factory you will have the privilege of processing qubits in our state-of-the-art production lines. By harnessing the power of quantum entanglement and superpositions you will help up deliver exciting new computational products to our valued customers!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >// ---------------------------------------------- //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Qubit Factory</i> is an open-ended puzzle game about building logic circuits to solve computational tasks, inspired by classic titles from developer Zachtronics. Based on authentic representations of quantum bits and components,\u00a0<i>The Qubit Factory\u00a0</i>features puzzles based on key concepts and algorithms from the field of <i>quantum computing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Ended Puzzles</strong> - Factory employees are encouraged to design their own unique solutions to given tasks. Bonuses will be awarded to those meeting strict efficiency criteria. Convoluted and/or poorly-optimized solutions will be frowned upon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faithful Physics</strong> - Designed and programmed by a real (semi-successful) research scientist in the field of quantum computing:  key concepts and algorithms from quantum computing are conveyed accurately, allowing players to build genuine knowledge about quantum computing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible</strong>- Core concepts are built slowly, with players encouraged to build foundational understanding in classical computing before progressing to quantum analogues. No prior computer/physics knowledge is assumed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adeptus Mechanicus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/ca4277950d70f5b6a2f24ad6d9d17e4b657e8183.jpg"},{"name":"Entanglement Maestro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/476ecbe8759efd42f1a868bd9bcb72dc636ee228.jpg"},{"name":"Certified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/398c0875232a53a36d6b411bb9454986d66974bb.jpg"},{"name":"Quantum Mechanic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/766faebd4a1f2788aa1760f3854bcf6a568ab055.jpg"},{"name":"Elementary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/d3cac8a4dd3f1ca27467fb2eba50de7afa319929.jpg"},{"name":"Malfunction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/113c2eb8345759f0f8777296e94f5860a05afb85.jpg"},{"name":"Difficulty Spike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/fddf7d457c53497a75f9c0d1e0a5db283d082d3d.jpg"},{"name":"Platinum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/f2c42daa48040d576d340c66cdf47e0e52763096.jpg"},{"name":"Boolean Logistician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/6cf9b6f348221dbd7da1029e06c1689e70856558.jpg"},{"name":"Quantum Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3121980/78a978d9bf243ebeab8093d79feef4a710096b20.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3121980?t=1754065747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/723d3041f281efaad1cff25e1ca289a94117cde3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754065747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/cb56b3ec903e78f68456592abc3595659e784f69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754065747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/cb56b3ec903e78f68456592abc3595659e784f69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754065747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >// New Employee Onboarding: Quantum Computing //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below are <i>classical bits</i>, which all regular computers operate on. Boooooring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/e48b05bdbd2bbf00a4ed5d10979dd8e1.poster.avif?t=1754065747\" width=400 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/e48b05bdbd2bbf00a4ed5d10979dd8e1.webm?t=1754065747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/e48b05bdbd2bbf00a4ed5d10979dd8e1.mp4?t=1754065747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more exciting are\u00a0<i>quantum bits</i>\u00a0(or <i>qubits</i> for short), which are not limited to simple {0,1} states.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0  \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/39db046652040981ac0a914a2f2353f7.poster.avif?t=1754065747\" width=400 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/39db046652040981ac0a914a2f2353f7.webm?t=1754065747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/extras/39db046652040981ac0a914a2f2353f7.mp4?t=1754065747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qubits are so hot right now! They are the building blocks of newfangled\u00a0<i>quantum computers</i>. As newly-minted employees of The Qubit Factory you will have the privilege of processing qubits in our state-of-the-art production lines. By harnessing the power of quantum entanglement and superpositions you will help up deliver exciting new computational products to our valued customers!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >// ---------------------------------------------- //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Qubit Factory</i> is an open-ended puzzle game about building logic circuits to solve computational tasks, inspired by classic titles from developer Zachtronics. Based on authentic representations of quantum bits and components,\u00a0<i>The Qubit Factory\u00a0</i>features puzzles based on key concepts and algorithms from the field of <i>quantum computing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Ended Puzzles</strong> - Factory employees are encouraged to design their own unique solutions to given tasks. Bonuses will be awarded to those meeting strict efficiency criteria. Convoluted and/or poorly-optimized solutions will be frowned upon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faithful Physics</strong> - Designed and programmed by a real (semi-successful) research scientist in the field of quantum computing:  key concepts and algorithms from quantum computing are conveyed accurately, allowing players to build genuine knowledge about quantum computing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible</strong>- Core concepts are built slowly, with players encouraged to build foundational understanding in classical computing before progressing to quantum analogues. No prior computer/physics knowledge is assumed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Logical Basis"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121980/46bea61d1217768be9af81f5e9ec2d1d893eca8d/header.jpg?t=1754065747","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11.2+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11.2+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3121980/729009/6ef2aac798b31b6b7f3cdf9b9a8640583725a861/1750872576/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749105752","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3121980/729009/6ef2aac798b31b6b7f3cdf9b9a8640583725a861/1750872576/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749105752","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3121980/729009/6ef2aac798b31b6b7f3cdf9b9a8640583725a861/1750872576/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749105752","id":257039505,"name":"Qubit Factory Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257039505/3923a214844b9d888b3dbb348b29dd9502adf0fa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749105752"}],"name":"The 